## ⚕️ Medical & Clinical AI Disclaimer

**AppealForge** is an assistive software tool designed to optimize administrative appeals workflows using artificial intelligence (DeepSeek and Qwen foundation models via Featherless AI).

By utilizing this software, you agree to the following terms:

### 1. No Medical or Legal Advice
AppealForge provides automated drafting assistance. It does **not** provide clinical diagnosis, medical care plans, or formal legal counsel.

### 2. Mandatory Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) Verification
Although the system features an adversarial **Dual-Model Architecture** (Lead Drafter + Clinical Auditor) to cross-examine claims against medical records and CMS NCD/LCD guidelines, all generated outputs must be reviewed and validated by a licensed physician, clinical reviewer, or certified billing specialist prior to filing.

### 3. Regulatory & Privacy Compliance
This software operates with a **Local-First / Zero-Cloud-Storage** architecture. Deployers are responsible for ensuring that their environment and credential handling adhere to all relevant **HIPAA**, **HITECH**, and local patient privacy requirements.
